{"game": "palworld", "language": "english", "appid": 1623730, "month": "2025-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1740182400, "end_date": 1740787199, "month_true_total": 1741, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 16:58:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "189001625", "author": {"steamid": "76561198168299292", "personaname": "Magical E.T.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tituscerebritis/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 53456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 13126, "playtime_at_review": 17248, "last_played": 1791392149, "avatar": "55df3043df3e1dee46451d736fb4915539ba80bc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Obviously, you can see the hours I've played. Do you really think I want to recommend this on another human being?\nEspecially if you're on the autism spectrum (like a lot of fellow Pokemon enthusiasts).\n\nI want to like this game. Given how much a large corporation hates it and all.\n\nBut between the heavy graphical requirements you need to play it, the obnoxious craft-this, search-blindly-for-those, craft-that gameplay loop; and how obsolete your favorite Pal and factory setup become after about three levels...\n\nI'M an obsessive who's in this for the long haul. I want to see how the game ends. But you have the option to save yourself.", "timestamp_created": 1740785053, "timestamp_updated": 1786834647, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473366290330886841", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "188999965", "author": {"steamid": "76561199421285834", "personaname": "PINKGUY", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dcbrooks68/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_f